    "scale_anchor_mm": 150,
    "assembly_notes": "The main member (u_bracket) is secured to the vehicle body via its mounting wall, with upper and lower parallel extensions carrying aligned pintle pin holes on a vertical hinge axis. A U-shaped link member pivots between these extensions on the pintle pin, and its base wall exterior guide surface engages the door-half member's leaf flange during lift-off. The door-half member (u_bracket oriented as bight wall plus sidewalls) receives the pintle pin through its leaf flange hole to complete the lift-off hinge."
  }
